      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCRUB'S BLUE (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at Q Lakeside in a handy 21.57 beating Spring Grim. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Well placed and can measure up. GOODNESS BABY (3) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Q Parklands over 520m behind Hara's Neo (30.69) in a Grade 5. Likely to play a prominent role. HARA'S USAIN (1) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (20.20) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Should be in this for a long way. ICE RIDER (2) is right in the mix.",
